# One byte-identical checkout everywhere. The docs-truth suite compares
# generated documents (STABILITY.md) and parses markdown/YAML byte-for-byte;
# a CRLF checkout — the default on Windows runners — fails all of it for no
# real reason. Binary files are untouched: `text=auto` only applies to what
# git already detects as text.
* text=auto eol=lf
